EFG 2 R "Centipede game, 4 move" { "Player 1" "Player 2" }
"The 4-move centipede game (Figure 1) from the experiment in :cite:p:`McKPal92`,
reanalyzed using agent quantal response equilibrium in :cite:p:`McKPal98`."

p "" 1 1 "(1,1)" { "TAKE" "PASS" } 0
t "" 1 "Outcome 1" { 0.40, 0.10 }
p "" 2 1 "(2,1)" { "TAKE" "PASS" } 0
t "" 2 "Outcome 2" { 0.20, 0.80 }
p "" 1 2 "(1,2)" { "TAKE" "PASS" } 0
t "" 3 "Outcome 3" { 1.60, 0.40 }
p "" 2 2 "(2,2)" { "TAKE" "PASS" } 0
t "" 4 "Outcome 4" { 0.80, 3.20 }
t "" 5 "Outcome 5" { 6.40, 1.60 }
